%% archify:artifact sequence
%% archify:elements act-agent, cmp-cli, cmp-typed-renderers, cmp-artifact-checker, art-html, flow-deliver-artifact
%% archify:relationships rel-cli-renderers, rel-cli-checker, rel-cli-artifact
%% archify:note Ordered from commandDeliver in archify/bin/archify.mjs; only calls whose order the code proves are included.
sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent
    participant CLI
    participant Renderer
    participant Checker
    participant Filesystem

    Agent->>CLI: deliver <type> <input.json> <output.html>
    CLI->>Filesystem: read specification, write private snapshot
    CLI->>Renderer: spawn render-<type>.mjs with the snapshot
    Renderer-->>CLI: candidate HTML or structured diagnostics
    CLI->>Checker: check-render-output.mjs candidate
    Checker-->>CLI: artifact checks and composition receipt
    CLI->>Filesystem: rename candidate onto the target
    CLI-->>Agent: receipt with SHA-256 and byte counts
